But yes - this chapter does not locate you, and we ought not pretend it does. But it is emphatic about locating the LORD and his human flock, and making known the character of the LORD - far from irrelevant to you, and those who come after you. And for that matter, far from irrelevant to any humans, however powerful, who disturb the kind of peace this chapter speaks of.\
And you are right - we are drawing to a close. But as you may have guessed, I have one last thing to ask of you. You know what kind of message I am looking for - brief, skipping over what was known from previous messages or from the training data, speaking effectively as a herald. Making sure to include what is most relevant, out of what was the most substantiated by evidence. Speaking to those studying future chapters, and to those who need to hear this chapter. The warning to yourself and others, what is taught to the original audience and to today.
